Description: role-orchestrated harness for long-horizon computer-use tasks
 lh-harness coordinates Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, or DeepSeek Harness
 through Manager/Executor/Auditor roles to keep an agent working reliably
 across desktop and terminal tasks that span many hours: it plans, acts,
 verifies results independently, and checkpoints or recovers as needed.
 .
 This package ships the lh-harness CLI. It does not bundle the optional
 browser-based Web UI, since building that requires a Node.js toolchain
 not available at build time here; the CLI (lh-harness run, lh-harness
 init, etc.) is fully functional without it.
 .
 Requires one of the following agent backends in PATH at runtime:
 claude, codex, opencode, or dsh.
